WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.152
In this practice, the grades table is long.

00:00:03.152 --> 00:00:06.807
Each row represents one student and course grade.

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:13.082
Your goal is to create one row per student, with selected course grades in separate columns.

00:00:13.082 --> 00:00:19.122
Before writing the query, state the output grain, identify the course categories,

00:00:19.122 --> 00:00:22.027
and decide how a missing course should appear.

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:27.040
A missing grade should normally remain null rather than being changed to zero.
